.TH GO-MCP-EXECUTOR 7 "2026-04-10" "go-mcp 0.0.9" "Go MCP Framework"
.SH NAME
go-mcp-executor \- process management abstraction for MCP servers
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import "code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/executor"
import "code.linenisgreat.com/purse-first/libs/go-mcp/executor/nix"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B executor
package provides a process management abstraction for MCP servers that
need to manage subprocesses. A Nix implementation is available at
.B executor/nix
for building and running Nix flake references.
.SH TYPES
.SS Executor Interface
.nf
type Executor interface {
    Build(ctx context.Context, spec string) (string, error)
    Execute(ctx context.Context, path string,
        args []string) (*Process, error)
}
.fi
.TP
.B Build
Resolves a spec (e.g., a Nix flake reference) to an executable path.
.TP
.B Execute
Launches a subprocess and returns a Process handle.
.SS Process
.nf
type Process struct {
    Stdin  io.WriteCloser
    Stdout io.ReadCloser
    Stderr io.ReadCloser
    Wait   func() error
    Kill   func() error
}
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR go-mcp (7),
.BR go-mcp-server (7)
